                <mxCell id="c3_ik_solver" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 15px; color: rgb(19, 78, 74);&quot;&gt;Dual-Arm IK Solver&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px; color: rgb(30, 102, 90);&quot;&gt;• MINK (Damped Levenberg-Marquardt with Limits)&lt;br&gt;• DLS &amp;amp; Pyroki Analytical Fallback&lt;br&gt;• SE(3) Target Poses → 14 DoF Arm Joint Angles&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#b4e4d4;strokeColor=#529881;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#134e4a;align=center;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;" parent="1" vertex="1">
