                <mxCell id="c3_safety_layer" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 15px; color: rgb(19, 78, 74);&quot;&gt;SafetyLayer (5 Hardware Locks)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px; color: rgb(30, 102, 90);&quot;&gt;🔒 L1: Joint Limits (Wrist pitch ±0.45, yaw ±0.35)&lt;br&gt;🔒 L2: Velocity Cap (0.3 rad/s, step &amp;le; max_vel·dt)&lt;br&gt;🔒 L3: 300 ms Deadman Watchdog (Auto-trip on silence)&lt;br&gt;🔒 L4: Position Deviation Gate (&amp;gt;0.05 rad for &amp;gt;200 ms)&lt;br&gt;🔒 L5: Fault Latch (Requires typed confirmation clear)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#b4e4d4;strokeColor=#529881;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#134e4a;align=center;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;" parent="1" vertex="1">
